Scene 3:Telephone/Lecture
Proog|Emo, This way|doi .imos. ti farna
|Follow me!|
|Hurry, Emo!|

|You're not paying attention!|
Emo| I just want to answer the phone|
Proog|Emo, look, I mean listen!|
|You have to learn to listen|
|This is not some game|
|You, I mean we, could easily die out here|
|Listen, listen to the sounds of the machine|
|Listen to your breathing|
Emo|(laughs)

Scene 4: Typewriter
Emo|Well, don't you ever get tired of this?|
Proog|Tired?!?|
|Emo, the machine is like- like clockwork|
|One move out of place...|
|And you're ground to a pulp|
Emo|But isn't it -|
Proog|Pulp, Emo!|
|Is that what you want, pulp?|
|Emo, your goal in life?|
|Pulp! (very strong echo)|

Scene 5: Proog shows Emo stuff
Proog|Emo, close your eyes|
Emo|Why?|
Proog|Now!|
Emo|Ok|
Proog|Good|
|What do you see at your left side, Emo?|
|Well?|
Emo|Nothing|
Proog|Really?|
Emo|No, nothing at all|
Proog|And at your right,|
|What do you see at your right side, Emo?|
Emo|The same Proog, exactly the same|
|Nothing!|
Proog|Great|

Scene 6: Which way
Emo|Listen Proog! Do you hear that! Can we go here?|
Proog|There..? It isn't safe, Emo|
Emo|But|
Proog|Trust me, it's not|
Emo|Maybe I could go...|
Proog|No|
Emo|But|
Proog|NO|
Emo|It|
Proog|NO|
Proog|Any further questions?|
Emo|No.|

Scene 7:Emo flips out
Proog|Emo|
Emo|Yeah?|
Proog|Emo, why?|
|Emo, why, why can't you see the beauty of this place?|
|The way it works... how- how perfect it is|
Emo|No, Proog, I don't see!|
|I don't see because there's nothing there!|
|And why should I trust my life to something that isn't there?|
|Can you tell me that?|
Proog|Emo|
Emo|Answer me!!|

Scene 8: Emo creates
Emo|Proog, you're a sick man|
Proog|Emo|
Emo|Stay away from me|
Proog|Emo|
|No!! Emo! It's a trap!|
Emo|It's a trap|
|At the left side you can see...
|The hanging gardens of Babylon!|
|How's that for a trap?|
Proog|No, Emo|
Emo|At your right side you can see...|
|Guess what! the colossus of Rhodes!|
